window.products.push({"id":929059,"name":"Discreet Toilet Brush and Metal Canister Holder by MAYA | Built In Splash Guard, Tapered Head, Compact and Elegant Design For Small Bathroom Spaces, M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZGG4CWNYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make your toilet sparkle with this decorative toilet brush and canister by MAYA. The tapered design of the brush head makes it easy to clean under the rim and in all those hard-to-reach areas. The bristles are designed to be firm enough to scrub away dirt, while still soft enough to prevent the water from splattering while cleaning the toilet. Brush head is white to prevent staining of the toilet bowl. Lid doubles as a splash guard to prevent the dirty water from spraying on you while you scrub. Constructed from durable rust-resistant metal, this brush and holder set is designed to deliver quality use and last through frequent cleanings. When stowed away, the brush is completely contained in its own containment cylinder for neat and elegant storage. The classy and elegant design of the sleek holder transforms this bathroom necessity into a decorative accessory. The canister is built with both style and practicality in mind; elegant bronze design complements existing bathroom décor and keeps the brush easily accessible yet out-of-sight. The compact design of this toilet brush and canister set makes it the perfect choice for apartments and small bathrooms, and looks great in larger rooms as well. Additional matching bathroom accessories are available and sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZGG4CWNYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maya","source_asin":"B07B4147DH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B4147DH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B4147DH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
