window.products.push({"id":929167,"name":"CALA Sofa Slipcovers,Covers,Reversible Couch Slipcover Furniture Protector with Elastic Straps,Covers Perfect for Pets and Kids,Machine Washable（Overs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wjRWN1UzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CALA brand specialized in household items,dedicated to bringing high quality and comfortable product to you. This slipcover shields and protects your furniture from spills, stains, wear and tear to prevent it from getting ruined. It’s great for homes with children and pets, or for anyone seeking an economical solution for furniture protection. WHAT SIZE SHOULD I ORDER? We HIGHLY RECOMMEND measuring before ordering as every piece of furniture is unique and we want you to be happy with the fit. You can find a detailed measuring guide in the photos or measure the seat width as follows: Sofa Oversized: seat width up to 78\" Futon: seat width up to 70\" Sofa: seat width up to 68\" Loveseat: seat width up to 46\" Recliner: seat width up to 30\" Chair: seat width up to 21\" HOW CAN I BE SURE THE PROTECTOR WILL STAY SECURE? CALA sofa slipcover includes two 2\" adjustable elastic straps, It goes on the side back of the sofa cover, there are two clasps on each end to hook the strap too then stretch it across to the other end on the back of the sofa. It can reduce slipping.Please note, minor adjustments will be needed with rowdy dogs and kids. This is recommended for fabric covered furniture not for leather couch. WILL IT PROTECT MY FURNITURE? Yes, it will protect your furniture from hair and dirt. While it will help a little with liquids, this is not water proof. This is intentional as a waterproof cover will just result in the liquids rolling onto the floor. CAN I PUT THIS IN THE WASHING MACHINE? Of course. This couch cover is machine washable and dryer safe. Directions are included with the cover. IF I ORDER IT AND IT DOES’S FIT, CAN I RETURN IT? Absolutely. We want you to be happy. If you are not happy for any reason (even after Amazon return window), please reach out to us directly for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wjRWN1UzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAZY CALA LIFE","source_asin":"B07DGW5B74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DGW5B74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DGW5B74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
