window.products.push({"id":929201,"name":"MFSTUDIO Sideboard Buffet Storage Cabinet with 3 Drawers & 3 Doors Farmhouse Cupboard Console Table for Living Room, Dining Room, Hallway Furniture, F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lyB2PQGVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Buffet Cabinet & Sideboard with Storage】: Overall Dimension: 47\"L x 14.6\"W x 30.3\"H. This freestanding vintage chic cabinet features 3 drawers, 3 doors and 6 lattices with roomy storage space to contain some odd things, messy toys, snacks, books, magazines or towels so as to make your kitchen and dining room clean and tidy. *Top load capacity: 200 lbs. The classic walnut color and stylish design make it a distinctive furniture piece that balances with a variety of decor styles. 【Sturdy Hand Made Sideboard Table】: This dining room table with adjustable shelves is made of solid wood frame and premium painted MDF board, which is sturdy and durable. Each cabinet is handmade and hand finished, and this buffet cabinet can support a standard microwave or toaster oven. 【Tall Accent Storage Cabinet】: The storage cabinet organizer is sturdy enough and very easy to clean. And we process very strict quality check from the very beginning to the delivery of the item. Combining the elegance and functionality, the kitchen counter can fit various decoration styles. It fits in not only your kitchen, but also living room, bathroom, or entrance. 【Versatile Usage Sideboard】: This console table features wood look matching with iron handles, which will become a captivating addition to the whole home decor. With clean lines and elegant door-front design, it is a perfect choice to add a touch of high-end and rustic charm to your room. 【About Assembly & Service】: This console table comes with a clear and brief instruction. Each screw and pin have its own code to let you easily understand the assembly progress, taking little time and energy. In addition, the smooth surface is waterproof and easy to keep clean with a damp cloth. Please feel free to contact us If you have any problem with our cabinet, we will reply you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lyB2PQGVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MFSTUDIO","source_asin":"B09CD3F6PS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CD3F6PS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CD3F6PS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
