window.products.push({"id":929363,"name":"Meat Thermometer, DOQAUS Food Thermometer for Cooking, Digital BBQ Thermometer with Folding Probe, Calibration & Reversible Display, Instant Read Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gd6mIOcNL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FAST RESPONSE & ACCURATE】Takes a temperature in a little as 3 seconds, and is accurate to ±1 degrees with a wide range of -58℉-572℉. Allows you to get accurate food temperature faster, no more waiting over a hot stove or grill for the temperature to settle. Equipped multiple calibration functions are provided that can make your digital meat thermometer probe sensor back to the correct accuracy you wish, making it a kitchen thermometer for cooking that lasts a lifetime. 【IP6 WATERPROOF】Every gap in the bbq thermometer has a waterproof treatment, Real IP6 rated waterproof, the DOQAUS cooking thermometer can be washed under running water without fear! With a waterproof and strong break-resistant body, the food thermometer digital is highly durable and resilient. it can withstand accidental drops or other impact accidents. It is great for barbecue outdoors. 【POWERFUL FUNCTIONALITY】① Instant read meat thermometer digital with foldable 4.7\" Food grade stainless steel probe and auto-on/off function, to save battery power. ② Exclusive Anti-Fog auto-rotating allows you to read the numbers from any direction. ③ Switch easily between ℃ and ℉. ④ Large and bright LCD display with a backlight makes it very easy to read the temperature while cooking outdoors on sunny days or at night. 【EASY TO USE】 Easy to use, carry, and storage (the handing hole is also a bottle opener). It's the perfect solution for grilling, baking, deep frying, making candy, or using it to test the food temperature of your liquid, beer, wine, tea, coffee, milk, soup, etc. DOQAUS meat temperature probe's package includes 1 extra CR2032 battery and a bonus of a meat temperature chart that allows you to effortlessly cook mouthwatering meals. An ideal present for any cooking or bbq enthusiast. 【LIFETIME CUSTOMER SERVICE】DOQAUS products are rigorously tested and made by professionals. So, you take NO RISK by purchasing a DOQAUS turkey thermometer! Because we believe that you deserve the best. Please feel free to contact us via Amazon directly if you have any questions with food temperature probe thermometer or need any help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gd6mIOcNL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOQAUS","source_asin":"B09FQ1ZNVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FQ1ZNVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FQ1ZNVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
