window.products.push({"id":929425,"name":"4TH Emotion Halloween Decor Hocus Pocus Pillow Covers 18x18 Set of 4 Fall Pumpkin Farmhouse Decorations Trick or Treat Witch Candy Fall Pillows Decora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RVGbeXn9S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDES: Set of 4 Halloween candy pillow covers, No Insert or Filler.Pattern is only on the front and no printing on the back. (4TH Emotion pillow cover can help you to change halloween decorations quickly. also a super cute gift for your family and friends.) SIZE & MATERIAL: This pillow cover fits 18x18 inch insert, PLEASE NOTE: All of our pillow covers are made to ensure a snug fit. Each listing size refers to the pillow insert size and not the pillow cover size. To ensure the proper fit, we make all pillow covers slightly smaller (approximately 0.5\" smaller) than the insert size. Made of 100% Polyester linen, soft and skin-friendly, no fading or abrasion, can be used outdoors. EASY TO PUT ON: Color-coordinated hidden zipper closure brings an elegant appearance, and it’s super easy to stuff pillows/fillers into this pillow covers. WASHING TIPS: Machine wash in cold water separately, gently cycle only, dot not bleach. MATERIAL: Made of 100% Polyester linen, soft and skin-friendly, no fading or abrasion, can be used outdoors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RVGbeXn9S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"4TH Emotion","source_asin":"B097M7KC9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097M7KC9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097M7KC9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":929426,"name":"Zojirushi SW-EAE50KTWA Stainless Steel Food Jar, 17-Ounce, Hello Kitty Collection White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r33Wt6OOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Zojirushi began in Japan in 1918 as a manufacturer of hand-blown vacuum bottles. They are still known today for their high quality vacuum insulated products. This stainless steel food jar is vacuum insulated so it keeps foods (or beverages) hot or cold for hours. Durable and sanitary 18/8 stainless steel construction will not rust, tarnish or stain and will not leak harmful chemicals. The interior is polished stainless steel with a nonstick coating and is neutral to taste and smell. Tight -fitted lid has a gasket that seals lid to minimize leaks and maximize heat retention. It has a unique lid designed with a vent that allows users to release the pressure inside to make the lid easier to open when the food jar contains hot foods or beverages. A wide opening of 2 and one half inches makes it easy to fill and clean and allows user to eat directly out of the jar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r33Wt6OOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zojirushi","source_asin":"B0BB7B8S8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB7B8S8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB7B8S8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
