window.products.push({"id":929458,"name":"Linenwalas 100% Organic Cotton Percale Bed Pattern Sheets Set 4PC - Soft Luxurious Cotton Bedding (Short Queen, Gray Frette)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sWZomBmSL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"REFRESH COOL BEDDING: LINENWALAS provides you organic cotton sheets specially made from 100% Long Staple Cotton. The Organic Cotton bed sheets are known for their sweat-wicking feature. This temperature Balancing cotton sheets keep you cool and moisture-free during summer and warm and cozy during winters. These fully combed Organic Cotton Sheets are Ultra Soft, Long Lasting, Durable, and Luxurious Bedding Sheets. LINENWALAS PERFECT SNUG FIT: This Organic Cotton 16 inches Deep Pocket Short Queen-Size sheets set is stitched using premium quality elastic to give fitted sheet tight fitting. Fitted sheet fits mattresses from 9” to 16” thick. Short Queen sheets: 94” x 102”; Fully Elastic Fitted sheet having pockets depth: 60” x 75” + 16”; with 2 Standard Pillowcases: 20” x 30”. This Organic Cotton Short Queen Bedsheets and Pillowcase have a stylish Hem detailing across the border. GENUINE 300 THREAD COUNT PERCALE SHEETS: These sheets set will provide you an endless comfort of Luxurious Hotel Class Linen at an AFFORDABLE price. This 300 Thread Count Pure Organic Percale Cotton Sheet Set has low maintenance, and easy care is required. We at LINENWALAS make sheets from premium quality fabric without using any dyes which get faded over time, thus keeping sheet bright-toned even after prolonged use. But using cream or bleach to clean sheets may lead to color fade. GOODNESS OF NATURE: All our Organic Cotton Sheets are MADE IN GREEN and are Certified by GOTS. According to the policies, these sheet sets are tested for various parameters i.e; they are manufactured in a socially responsible manner with Eco-friendly ways. Each product batch is also tested for numerous different parameters such as long-lasting, durability, low color fading, low shrinkage, and pilling. Each of our sheets set is further quality checked before packing. LINENWALAS ONE-YEAR WARRANTY: These cotton bedding sets are made from the superior quality processes and with best quality cottton. If you face any issues with the 100% cotton sheets set, please send us an email or contact us via amazon message. Your satisfaction is our number one priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sWZomBmSL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linenwalas","source_asin":"B07GZWH1PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GZWH1PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GZWH1PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
