window.products.push({"id":929576,"name":"Insieme Bed Strap Twin to King Bed Conversion - Transform Two Twins into a King Size Bed in Minutes with This Mattress Joiner - Sleep Like a King on T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Of0RW9SxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nylon INEXPENSIVE TWIN TO KING CONVERTER SOLUTION - No need to spend several times more for a twin to king bed bridge, split king bed bridge, or bed gap filler. Simply use the bed connectors mattress joiner to keep your mattresses from sliding apart. It's the easiest, most affordable way to hold your mattresses in place and sleep in comfort. Not recommended for joining mattresses that are not the same height or thickness. INEXPENSIVE TWIN TO KING CONVERTER SOLUTION - No need to spend several times more for a twin to king bed bridge, split king bed bridge, or bed gap filler. Simply use the bed connectors mattress joiner to keep your mattresses from sliding apart. It's the easiest, most affordable way to hold your mattresses in place and sleep in comfort. Not recommended for joining mattresses that are not the same height or thickness. HIGH QUALITY MADE TO LAST - This thick bed strap is 33 feet long & extra wide (1.4 inches) to handle a variety of mattress size combinations. The strap is made of heavy-duty webbing and has a reinforced no-slip metal buckle making it easy to tighten the strap and keep it in fastened in place. EASY SET-UP - Quickly convert two smaller-sided mattresses to a larger one in 3 easy steps: (1) slide mattresses together (2) wrap bed strap around them, and (3) insert strap through metal buckle and pull tight. VERSATILE - Use with any size mattresses to increase bed size (twin, twin XL, full/double). Get the same result as if you used a more pricey mattress gap filler, bed bridge twin to king. or split king gap filler. Works for a variety of split king adjustable beds too. These bed straps for mattresses simply do the trick when you are in a hurry. GREAT FOR GUESTS - Quickly convert two singles to a king all by yourself. Easy to convert back once your company leaves. After usage, simply roll up the strap for convenient and compact storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Of0RW9SxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Insieme","source_asin":"B08L4JB4FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L4JB4FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L4JB4FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
