window.products.push({"id":929622,"name":"Wagan 2577 Personal Fridge/Warmer - 7L Capacity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417NZu9q3tL._AC_.jpg","description":"Wagan’s 7 Liter 12v personal fridge/warmer saves you money and time! It is perfect for anyone who feels hungry or thirsty while driving by keeping snacks and drinks accessible at all times. Enjoy healthy snacks such as a cold crisp apple, yogurt with granola, or dark chocolate that won’t melt when you’re ready to eat it. Use this to avoid detouring from your intended driving route, avoid waiting in line just to quench your thirst or purchase a warm meal, and continue driving to your destination. This 7L 12v cooler/warmer is ideal for road trips or for anyone who spends time in a vehicle. It offers both convenience and comfort within an arm’s reach.  Simply plug this into your vehicle’s 12v DC cigarette lighter outlet to use. The unit is designed to fit into your vehicle’s front console or it can be placed in the backseat. Includes a detachable 6 foot DC cord. The top of the cooler/warmer has 2 built-in cup holders and even a comfortable armrest too. Its 7 liter capacity holds the equivalent of up to 9 soda cans.  Its recessed lid allows for tall bottles to fit inside too. Use this to keep food and drinks either cool or warm while you’re on the go. Both cooling and warming functions provide versatility; simply add your items inside and adjust the switch to your desired temperature setting. Easily keeps food and beverages cool from the refrigerator or warm from the oven, stove or microwave. Enjoy them when you’re en route to your destination or after you arrive. Superior foam insulation and energy efficiency allow the contents of your unit to reach a maximum cooling capacity of 35-40º F below room temperature – without the mess of melting ice! The heating function can reach a maximum of 140º F. Its adjustable shoulder strap allows for easy transport from one place to another. An optional AC adapter is available (Wagan item 9903) for using this cooler/warmer outside of the vehicle too, such as at your home, office, hotel or dorm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417NZu9q3tL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wagan","source_asin":"B001RKH7FS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001RKH7FS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001RKH7FS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
