window.products.push({"id":929710,"name":"Singer 132 Featherweight Compact Efficiency Sewing Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WGYKD59HL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sew on the go or anywhere in the house with this lightweight and compact Singer sewing machine. It's portable (less than 15 lb.) but loaded with options like 32 stitch functions and electronic speed control. Enjoy the ease of a 6-second threading system, a 2-needle position selector and push-button reverse. Make fast work of buttons with the quick 5-step buttonhole feature. Comes packed with accessories including a pack of needles, 4 bobbins, dust cover, 2 screwdrivers, seam ripper, brush, spool pins and felts, standard pressure foot, buttonhole foot, zipper foot, blind stitch foot and instructions in English and Spanish. Imported. Amazon.com Compact, lightweight (under 15 pounds), capable of 32 stitch functions, and loaded with other options, this Singer machine is simple to operate and makes it possible for even novices to enjoy creative sewing. Some of the convenience features include a 6-second, easy threading system with automatic needle-thread tension; an electronically controlled foot pedal for smoothly maintaining or changing speeds; push-button reverse sewing for neat seam-ends; a two-needle position selector for attaching zippers and top stitching; and a built-in five-step buttonholer for easy buttonhole sewing. The machine is quiet and ruggedly built, includes a sewing light, and has a slide-off extension table for free-arm sewing. Real excitement comes from the 32 stitch functions provided, including, for example, six stretch zigzags, scallop, and crown. A complete accessory package (various presser feet, friction-free spool holders, transparent bobbins, and needles for sewing different fabrics) is included. Invaluable is Singer's illustrated, step-by-step instruction booklet covering everything from the basics to zipper sewing to pattern stitching to free-arm sewing to highly detailed buttonhole sewing--and much, much more. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WGYKD59HL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SINGER","source_asin":"B00005NWQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005NWQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005NWQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":929711,"name":"Sweese 138.603 Porcelain Bowls - 18 Ounce for Cereal, Salad, Dessert - Set of 6, Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518g-I4dWlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE TOP OF RIM (FLOWER SHAPE), ROUND INSIDE - Are you looking for a unique shape bowl set, which is outstanding among the normal bowls? These bowls can meet your need. We were inspired by the flower's shape and tried to design a set of bowls to bring nature's gift to the table. So, we made this series of bowls. And the rim of those is flower shape, but the inside is round and smooth, making them easier to serve you. LEAD & CADMIUM FREE - We care about your user experience so we devote ourselves to making great quality bowls for you. These Sweese bowls, made of a type of premium clay, are lead & cadmium-free, chip-resistant, scratch-resistant, and sturdier than stoneware. The creation of Sweese ensures you get what you pay for. PERFECT SIZE & VERSATILE - The little bowls are just the right size for salads, ice cream, and individual desserts, or even pasta, soup, cereal. You can also use them for food prepping. They work well for a variety of uses. SAFE FOR DISHWASHER & EASY TO STACK - They don't be stained easily as many plastic bowls do. Safe for dishwasher, freezer, microwave, and oven as well. And it's easy to clean by hand if needed. Meanwhile, these Sweese bowls can stack well and take up little space in the kitchen cupboard. AN IDEAL GIFT - These Sweese bowl sets are well packaged, a perfect gift for your friends and family on Housewarming, Wedding parties, Mothers' Day, Fathers' Day, Christmas, and New Year's Day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518g-I4dWlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweese","source_asin":"B09QFH97N1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QFH97N1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QFH97N1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
