window.products.push({"id":929770,"name":"VUYUYU Fabric Electric Recliner Chair, Massage Recliner with Heated and Remote Control, Home Theater Seating for Living Room, Office, Bedroom (Camel)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":349.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S4lFxqiOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for a comfortable and durable recliner with massage function, or looking for a gift for your elder parents? Please try our massage reclining chair, it will be a good choice for you. It can be used in your living room, bedroom, home theater or even your office. Features: Adjustable reclining angle by buttons enables you to enjoy relaxation Easy to adjust the modes to meet your requirement  with remote control 1 lumbar heating, 8-point massaging and 5 vibrating modes can turn off in fixed time 15/30/60 minutes Retractable footrest & push-back backrest simultaneously, satisfy different rest requirements(Recline up to 140 degrees) Underseat structure is made of durable metal to support body weight, weight capacity: 320 lbs Thick and soft sponge padded back, seat and wide armrest for ultimate comfort High quality fabric surface bring a warm and soft tactile impression, also anti-felting and anti-pilling USB outlets easily charge your low power devices, like mobile phone, iPad Side pockets convenient to store remote & small things and have a drink The wire was hidden in the back of the sofa, convenient for use and will not affect it’s fashionable appearance Specification: Material: Fuzz Linen Fabric + Wood frame + Foam Overall Dimension: 38.2\"(W) x 29\"(D) x 39.8\"(H) Seat Area: 19.7\"-23\"(W) x 19.3\"(D) Seat Height: 15.7\" Reclining Angle: 130° Max Capacity: 300lbs Package Included: 1 x Power Recliner Chair 1 x Remote control 1 x Assembly instruction Note： This recliner chair will send in 2 boxes, the delivery time of each box may be different, please waiting patiently. If there is any damaged parts of massage recliner, please contact us first, we will provide best solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S4lFxqiOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VUYUYU","source_asin":"B0C7VS1F2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7VS1F2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7VS1F2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":929771,"name":"Crema Coffee Products | 54mm Bottomless Naked Portafilter | Filter Basket Included | Fits 54mm Breville Machines | Olivewood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DYQ7uVa4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Game Changer for Perfect Extraction Bottomless (aka naked) portafilters are an essential tool for identifying and correcting extraction problems that cannot be seen with standard spouted portafilters. Plus, who doesn't love seeing those beautiful tiger stripes? NEW FEATURE UPDATE: We've modified our bottomless portafilters to now include a 15° tilt to the handle, providing improved grip and ergonomics. This 54mm bottomless portafilter was designed to work with the Breville/Sage Barista Express, Barista Express Impress, Barista Pro, Barista Touch, Bambino, Bambino Plus, Infuser and Duo-Temp Pro. Double-shot, single wall filter basket included. PLEASE NOTE: Channeling and spurting can be very messy, but are EXTREMELY common. This is not a defect of the portafilter itself, but instead is your coffee telling you that there's room for improvement in your preparation process (grind size, tamping, distribution, etc.).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DYQ7uVa4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CREMA COFFEE PRODUCTS","source_asin":"B08KSM1DLT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-929771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KSM1DLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KSM1DLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
